---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service — Veazen"
  description="Veazen terms of service."
  path="/terms"
>
  <main>
    <p class="kicker">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <p class="dim">
        <strong>Draft skeleton — not yet legally reviewed.</strong> The final
        terms are being prepared with counsel and will replace this page before
        general availability. They will cover, at minimum:
      </p>
      <ul class="dim">
        <li>The service: code generation, verification, traceability and risk alerting</li>
        <li>Acceptable use and prohibited conduct</li>
        <li>Plan limits, billing and cancellation</li>
        <li>Data ownership: your product and scan data remain yours</li>
        <li>Evidence reports and their intended use</li>
        <li>Liability limits and dispute resolution</li>
        <li>Contact: hello@veazen.app · Veazen™ is a product of VEAZEN LLC</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin-top: 0.4rem; }
  ul { margin-top: 0.8rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
</style>
